# Generated dataset artifacts — deliberately NOT committed.
#
# These are machine-generated, rewrite-in-full on every daily scan, and reached
# ~200 MB in the working tree (a 90 MB combined GeoJSON alone), which made the
# repository slow to clone and impossible to keep healthy long-term. They are
# published instead, at the same paths, from two places that already served the
# website:
#   * GitHub Pages  → /data/…   (restored from the release by the deploy jobs)
#   * GitHub Release "data-latest"  → flock_cameras.geojson, flock_cameras.csv,
#     by_oui.zip     (the canonical download for humans/scripts)
# The small, diffable, hand-curated artifacts (flock_ouis.csv, scan_stats.json,
# candidate_ouis.json, …) stay tracked — see README "Where is the data?".
data/flock_cameras.geojson
data/flock_cameras.csv
data/by_oui/

# Logs
*.log

# Temporary
tmp/
temp/
